[gd_scene format=3]

; The one variable: an ArrayMesh with LINES and LINE_STRIP surfaces in a MeshInstance3D, which Godot draws
; as one pixel wide segments under the surface material. Left to right: the default material, a lit red
; material, an unshaded green one, the red one with its node turned a half turn about Y, and a strip that
; reads its vertex colours. Godot lights a line, which has no normal array, as a +Z normal in node space:
; the sun, shining toward -Z, lights the first red box and not the turned one. Above them, a triangle
; surface and a lines surface in one mesh: Godot draws both.

